=g∇f+f∇g.\n$$\n\nUsing the product rule, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇[f(x,y)g(x,y)] & =g(x,y)∇f(x,y)+f(x,y)∇g(x,y) \\\\  & =(3 x - 4 y)((-1)\\,i+(1)\\,j)+(- x + y)((3)\\,i+(-4)\\,j) \\\\  & =(3 x - 4 y)(-1)i+(3 x - 4 y)(1)j+(- x + y)(3)i+(- x + y)(-4)j \\\\  & =(- 3 x + 4 y)i+(3 x - 4 y)j+(- 3 x + 3 y)i+(4 x - 4 y)j \\\\  & =(- 6 x + 7 y)\\,i+(7 x - 8 y)\\,j\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["135677e6-fc24-52c5-a111-90477ff87ed5"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "aacd3c03-67de-503a-b3c3-1e38459c9de3" :answer/id #uuid "aacd3c03-67de-503a-b3c3-1e38459c9de3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(- 6 x + 6 y)\\,i+(- 2 x + 2 y)\\,j" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "ecc90aec-cdb8-5523-a4f3-2ae3d600632d" :answer/id #uuid "ecc90aec-cdb8-5523-a4f3-2ae3d600632d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(- 12 x + 4 y)\\,i+(4 x + 4 y)\\,j" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "511ca0af-e50e-5e8b-893f-12bbf8d9f4af" :answer/id #uuid "511ca0af-e50e-5e8b-893f-12bbf8d9f4af" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(- 8 y)\\,i+(8 x)\\,j" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "36e183f3-6a67-5c16-9e23-ef10ececf338" :answer/id #uuid "36e183f3-6a67-5c16-9e23-ef10ececf338" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(- 6 x - 2 y)\\,i+(6 x + 2 y)\\,j" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "b0f45f57-3302-5746-b510-260125a96661" :answer/id #uuid "b0f45f57-3302-5746-b510-260125a96661" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(4 x + 4 y)\\,i+(- 12 x + 4 y)\\,j" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "3d3daa57-4d92-56f1-9dc7-324353b715ef" :answer-field/id #uuid "3d3daa57-4d92-56f1-9dc7-324353b715ef" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["aacd3c03-67de-503a-b3c3-1e38459c9de3" "ecc90aec-cdb8-5523-a4f3-2ae3d600632d" "511ca0af-e50e-5e8b-893f-12bbf8d9f4af" "36e183f3-6a67-5c16-9e23-ef10ececf338" "b0f45f57-3302-5746-b510-260125a96661"] :answer-fiel