ty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["cc542378-23c6-5f0d-a0d7-2fd9c737c526"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "02a9a90e-3590-57ce-857e-4738e4b8a96f" :answer/id #uuid "02a9a90e-3590-57ce-857e-4738e4b8a96f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(- 18 y)\\,i+(18 x)\\,j" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "17f10e04-4c44-5e8c-9a56-7bc02d440d7e" :answer/id #uuid "17f10e04-4c44-5e8c-9a56-7bc02d440d7e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(- 12 x - 12 y)\\,i+(6 x + 6 y)\\,j" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "b64fca02-3c60-59b5-9c60-0a6db140aa04" :answer/id #uuid "b64fca02-3c60-59b5-9c60-0a6db140aa04" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(- 6 x + 12 y)\\,i+(- 24 x - 6 y)\\,j" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "898bd464-6f82-5875-8fac-53de974047ce" :answer/id #uuid "898bd464-6f82-5875-8fac-53de974047ce" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(- 24 x - 6 y)\\,i+(- 6 x + 12 y)\\,j" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "65d4613a-986c-595a-b8e7-1e27d6799631" :answer/id #uuid "65d4613a-986c-595a-b8e7-1e27d6799631" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(- 12 x + 6 y)\\,i+(- 12 x + 6 y)\\,j" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "4bc44bad-0972-526a-a5f1-5498b898990c" :answer-field/id #uuid "4bc44bad-0972-526a-a5f1-5498b898990c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["02a9a90e-3590-57ce-857e-4738e4b8a96f" "17f10e04-4c44-5e8c-9a56-7bc02d440d7e" "b64fca02-3c60-59b5-9c60-0a6db140aa04" "898bd464-6f82-5875-8fac-53de974047ce" "65d4613a-986c-595a-b8e7-1e27d6799631"] :answer-field/correct "898bd464-6f82-5875-8fac-53de974047ce" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "d2782dea-5fc4-5e05-abad-5b0c5268e377" :question/id #uuid "d2782dea-5fc4-5e05-abad-5b0c5268e377" :question/problem "Find the gradient of the product $f(x,y)g(x,y),$ given that \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x,y) & =4 x - 2 y,\\quad ∇f(x,y)=(4)\\,i+(-2)\\,j \\\\ g(x,y) & =- 3 x - 3 y,\\quad ∇g(x,y)=(-3)\\,i+(-3)\\,j\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The gradient of the product of two functions $f(x,y)$ and $g(x,y)$ is given by\n\n$$\n∇[fg]=g∇f+f∇g.\n$$\n\nUsing the product rule, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇[f(x,y)g(x,y)] & =g(x,y)∇f(x,y)+f(x,y)∇g(x,y) \\\\  & =(- 3 x - 3 y)((4)\\,i+(-2)\\,j)+(4 x - 2 y)((-3)\\,i+(-3)\\,j) \\\\  & =(- 3 x - 3 y)(4)i+(- 3 x - 3 y)(-2)j+(4 x - 2 y)(-3)i+(4 x - 2 y)(-3)j \\\\  & =(- 12 x - 12 y)i+(6 x + 6 y)j+(- 12 x + 6 y)i+(- 12 x + 6 y)j \\\\  & =(- 24 x - 6 y)\\,i+(- 6 x + 12 y)\\,j\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["4bc44bad-0972-526a-a5f1-5498b898990c"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "6179bfd3-ad1a-57d5-9e85-07e8de87a9e4" :answer/id #uuid "6179bfd3-ad1a-57d5-9e85-07e8de87a9e4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\frac{2 x y^{3} z - y z^{3}}{x y z})\\,i+(\\frac{3 x^{2} y^{2} z - x z^{3}}{x y z})\\,j+(\\frac{x^{2} y^{3} - 3 x y z^{2}}{x y z})\\,k" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "e45afc2c-89cc-5d31-a291-04df0e43e302" :answer/id #uuid "e45afc2c-89cc-5d31-a291-04df0e43e302" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(y^{2})\\,i+(2 x y)\\,j+(- 2 z)\\,k" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "6544e835-303b-5d55-9ff4-bf9b2ff7f858" :answer/id #uuid "6544e835-303b-5d55-9ff4-bf9b2ff7f858" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(- \\frac{x^{2} y^{3} z - x y z^{3}}{x^{2} y z})\\,i+(- \\frac{x^{2} y^{3} z - x y z^{3}}{x y^{2} z})\\,j+(- \\frac{x^{2} y^{3} z - x y z^{3}}{x y z^{2}})\\,k" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "fe10362b-4bcf-503f-8c49-8dc2e3a0aca8" :answer/id #uuid "fe10362b-4bcf-503f-8c49-8dc2e3a0aca8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\frac{2 x y^{3} z - y z^{3}}{x y z} + \\frac{x^{2} y^{3} z - x y z^{3}}{x^{2} y z})\\,i+(\\frac{3 x^{2} y^{2} z - x z^{3}}{x y z} + \\frac{x^{2} y^{3} z - x y z^{3}}{x y^{2} z})\\,j+(\\frac{x^{2} y^{3} - 3 x y z^{2}}{x y z} + \\frac{x^{2} y^{3} z - x y z^{3}}{x y z^{2}})\\,k" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "6f4a1fb2-b6f5-56ce-8ca2-8933d289d531" :answer/id #uuid "6f4a1fb2-b6f5-56ce-8ca2-8933d289d531" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(2 x y)\\,i+(y^{2})\\,j+(- 2 z)\\,k" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "28bf2288-62d0-5f23-9d2d-c0fb16e9c57f" :answer-field/id #uuid "28bf2288-62d0-5f23-9d2d-c0fb16e9c57f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["6179bfd3-ad1a-57d5-9e85-07e8de87a9e4" "e45afc2c-89cc-5d31-a291-04df0e43e302" "6544e835-303b-5d55-9ff4-bf9b2ff7f858" "fe10362b-4bcf-503f-8c49-8dc2e3a0aca8" "6f4a1fb2-b6f5-56ce-8ca2-8933d289d531"] :answer-field/correct "e45afc2c-89cc-5d31-a291-04df0e43e302" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "af2e4ace-5861-5b18-b355-92218c8fda1e" :question/id #uuid "af2e4ace-5861-5b18-b355-92218c8fda1e" :question/problem "Find the gradient of the product $f(x,y,z)g(x,y,z),$ given that $f(x,y,z)=x^{2} y^{3} z - x y z^{3}$ and $g(x,y,z)=\\frac{1}{x y z}.$" :question/worked-solution "The gradient of the product of two functions $f(x,y,z)$ and $g(x,y,z)$ is given by\n\n$$\n∇[fg]=g∇f+f∇g.\n$$\n\nNow, we calculate the partial derivatives of $f(x,y,z):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂x} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(x^{2} y^{3} z - x y z^{3})=2 x y^{3} z - y z^{3} \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂y} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(x^{2} y^{3} z - x y z^{3})=3 x^{2} y^{2} z - x z^{3} \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂z} & =\\frac{∂}{∂z}(x^{2} y^{3} z - x y z^{3})=x^{2} y^{3} - 3 x y z^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇f(x,y,z) & =\\frac{∂f}{∂x}i+\\frac{∂f}{∂y}j+\\frac{∂f}{∂z}k=(2 x y^{3} z - y z^{3})\\,i+(3 x^{2} y^{2} z - x z^{3})\\,j+(x^{2} y^{3} - 3 x y z^{2})\\,k\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we calculate the partial derivatives of $g(x,y,z):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂g}{∂x} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(\\frac{1}{x y z})=- \\frac{1}{x^{2} y z} \\\\ \\frac{∂g}{∂y} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(\\frac{1}{x y z})=- \\frac{1}{x y^{2} z} \\\\ \\frac{∂g}{∂z} & =\\frac{∂}{∂z}(\\frac{1}{x y z})=- \\frac{1}{x y z^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇g(x,y,z) & =\\frac{∂g}{∂x}i+\\frac{∂g}{∂y}j+\\frac{∂g}{∂z}k=(- \\frac{1}{x^{2} y z})\\,i+(- \\frac{1}{x y^{2} z})\\,j+(- \\frac{1}{x y z^{2}})\\,k\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the product rule, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇[f(x,y,z)g(x,y,z)] & =g(x,y,z)∇f(x,y,z)+f(x,y,z)∇g(x,y,z) \\\\  & =(\\frac{1}{x y z})((2 x y^{3} z - y z^{3})\\,i+(3 x^{2} y^{2} z - x z^{3})\\,j+(x^{2} y^{3} - 3 x y z^{2})\\,k)+(x^{2} y^{3} z - x y z^{3})((- \\frac{1}{x^{2} y z})\\,i+(- \\frac{1}{x y^{2} z})\\,j+(- \\frac{1}{x y z^{2}})\\,k) \\\\  & =(\\frac{1}{x y z})(2 x y^{3} z - y z^{3})i+(\\frac{1}{x y z})(3 x^{2} y^{2} z - x z^{3})j+(\\frac{1}{x y z})(x^{2} y^{3} - 3 x y z^{2})k+(x^{2} y^{3} z - x y z^{3})(- \\frac{1}{x^{2} y z})i+(x^{2} y^{3} z - x y z^{3})(- \\frac{1}{x y^{2} z})j+(x^{2} y^{3} z - x y z^{3})(- \\frac{1}{x y z^{2}})k \\\\  & =(2 y^{2} - \\frac{z^{2}}{x})i+(3 x y - \\frac{z^{2}}{y})j+(\\frac{x y^{2}}{z} - 3 z)k+(- y^{2} + \\frac{z^{2}}{x})i+(- x y + \\frac{z^{2}}{y})j+(- \\frac{x y^{2}}{z} + z)k \\\\  & =(y^{2})\\,i+(2 x y)\\,j+(- 2 z)\\,k\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["28bf2288-62d0-5f23-9d2d-c0fb16e9c57f"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "39b3961c-518e-5fce-accc-1c06b8b99b28" :answer/id #uuid "39b3961c-518e-5fce-accc-1c06b8b99b28" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(- \\left(x + 1\\right) \\left(y + 4\\right) e^{x + 1} e^{y + 4} + \\left(y + 4\\right) e^{x + 1} e^{y + 4})\\,i+(\\left(x + 1\\right) \\left(y + 4\\right) e^{x + 1} e^{y + 4} - \\left(x + 1\\right) e^{x + 1} e^{y + 4})\\,j" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "884570ab-4fe3-58b8-bdc0-6fceffcbf5f8" :answer/id #uuid "884570ab-4fe3-58b8-bdc0-6fceffcbf5f8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\left(x + 1\\right) \\left(y + 5\\right) e^{x + y + 5})\\,i+(\\left(x + 2\\right) \\left(y + 4\\right) e^{x + y + 5})\\,j" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "913eb3b4-3e71-5d25-b83a-4d1c81d9ed5e" :answer/id #uuid "913eb3b4-3e71-5d25-b83a-4d1c81d9ed5e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\left(x + 1\\right) \\left(y + 4\\right) e^{x + 1} e^{y + 4})\\,i+(\\left(x + 1\\right) e^{x + 1} e^{y + 4})\\,j" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "65a001d5-1a9b-591e-90e3-44eedf041dfc" :answer/id #uuid "65a001d5-1a9b-591e-90e3-44eedf041dfc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\left(y + 4\\right) e^{x + 1} e^{y + 4})\\,i+(\\left(x + 1\\right) \\left(y + 4\\right) e^{x + 1} e^{y + 4})\\,j" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "e7f21048-bf93-5345-9339-7789610f673c" :answer/id #uuid "e7f21048-bf93-5345-9339-7789610f673c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\left(x + 2\\right) \\left(y + 4\\right) e^{x + y + 5})\\,i+(\\left(x + 1\\right) \\left(y + 5\\right) e^{x + y + 5})\\,j" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "1d71dcf6-8f66-56fb-9f80-76a6a0f2f0b0" :answer-field/id #uuid "1d71dcf6-8f66-56fb-9f80-76a6a0f2f0b0" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["39b3961c-518e-5fce-accc-1c06b8b99b28" "884570ab-4fe3-58b8-bdc0-6fceffcbf5f8" "913eb3b4-3e71-5d25-b83a-4d1c81d9ed5e" "65a001d5-1a9b-591e-90e3-44eedf041dfc" "e7f21048-bf93-5345-9339-7789610f673c"] :answer-field/correct "e7f21048-bf93-5345-9339-7789610f673c" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "ed54f79d-76c2-5f18-8276-7aa2bb85a756" :question/id #uuid "ed54f79d-76c2-5f18-8276-7aa2bb85a756" :question/problem "What is the gradient of the product $f(x,y)h(x,y)$ if $f(x,y)=(x+1){e}^{(y+4)}$ and $h(x,y)=(y+4){e}^{(x+1)}?$" :question/worked-solution "The gradient of the product of two functions $f(x,y)$ and $h(x,y)$ is given by:\n\n$$\n∇[fh]=f\\,∇\\,h+h\\,∇\\,f\\,\\,\n$$\n\nNow, we calculate the partial derivatives of $f(x,y):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂x} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}((x+1){e}^{(y+4)})={e}^{(y+4)} \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂y} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}((x+1){e}^{(y+4)})=(x+1){e}^{(y+4)}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇f(x,y) & =\\frac{∂f}{∂x}\\text{ }i+\\frac{∂f}{∂y}\\text{ }j={e}^{(y+4)}\\text{ }i+(x+1){e}^{(y+4)}\\text{ }j.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we calculate the partial derivatives of $h(x,y):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂h}{∂x} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}((y+4){e}^{(x+1)})=(y+4){e}^{(x+1)} \\\\ \\frac{∂h}{∂y} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}((y+4){e}^{(x+1)})={e}^{(x+1)}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇h(x,y) & =\\frac{∂h}{∂x}\\text{ }i+\\frac{∂h}{∂y}\\text{ }j=(y+4){e}^{(x+1)}\\text{ }i+{e}^{(x+1)}\\text{ }j.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, using the product rule, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇[f(x,y)h(x,y)] & =(x+1){e}^{(y+4)}((y+4){e}^{(x+1)}\\text{ }i+{e}^{(x+1)}\\text{ }j)+(y+4){e}^{(x+1)}({e}^{(y+4)}\\text{ }i+(x+1){e}^{(y+4)}\\text{ }j) \\\\  & =(x+1)(y+4){e}^{(x+1)+(y+4)}\\text{ }i+(x+1){e}^{(x+1)+(y+4)}\\text{ }j+(y+4){e}^{(x+1)+(y+4)}\\text{ }i+(x+1)(y+4){e}^{(x+1)+(y+4)}\\text{ }j \\\\  & =((x+1)+1)(y+4){e}^{(x+1)+(y+4)}\\text{ }i+(x+1)(1+(y+4)){e}^{(x+1)+(y+4)}\\text{ }j\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["1d71dcf6-8f66-56fb-9f80-76a6a0f2f0b0"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "c9802aa0-b1cb-55d1-b1a2-db8a145d6fee" :answer/id #uuid "c9802aa0-b1cb-55d1-b1a2-db8a145d6fee" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\left(x - 3\\right) \\left(y + 5\\right) e^{x + y + 1})\\,i+(\\left(x - 2\\right) \\left(y + 4\\right) e^{x + y + 1})\\,j" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "719a1d1a-12f8-5022-9387-d4a2458c0561" :answer/id #uuid "719a1d1a-12f8-5022-9387-d4a2458c0561" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(- \\left(x - 3\\right) \\left(y + 4\\right) e^{x - 3} e^{y + 4} + \\left(y + 4\\right) e^{x - 3} e^{y + 4})\\,i+(\\left(x - 3\\right) \\left(y + 4\\right) e^{x - 3} e^{y + 4} - \\left(x - 3\\right) e^{x - 3} e^{y + 4})\\,j" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "b92588a3-3fa2-54c2-83ba-e428830f5893" :answer/id #uuid "b92588a3-3fa2-54c2-83ba-e428830f5893" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\left(x - 2\\right) \\left(y + 4\\right) e^{x + y + 1})\\,i+(\\left(x - 3\\right) \\left(y + 5\\right) e^{x + y + 1})\\,j" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "d8c2888c-5aef-520c-adff-53f362fa29ec" :answer/id #uuid "d8c2888c-5aef-520c-adff-53f362fa29ec" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\left(y + 4\\right) e^{x - 3} e^{y + 4})\\,i+(\\left(x - 3\\right) \\left(y + 4\\right) e^{x - 3} e^{y + 4})\\,j" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "d31f9ad0-9696-5bd1-a8fc-68d9debd7a2b" :answer/id #uuid "d31f9ad0-9696-5bd1-a8fc-68d9debd7a2b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\left(x - 3\\right) \\left(y + 4\\right) e^{x - 3} e^{y + 4})\\,i+(\\left(x - 3\\right) e^{x - 3} e^{y + 4})\\,j" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "6595e956-1aae-5fc1-8097-0c7c2b14064a" :answer-field/id #uuid "6595e956-1aae-5fc1-8097-0c7c2b14064a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["c9802aa0-b1cb-55d1-b1a2-db8a145d6fee" "719a1d1a-12f8-5022-9387-d4a2458c0561" "b92588a3-3fa2-54c2-83ba-e428830f5893" "d8c2888c-5aef-520c-adff-53f362fa29ec" "d31f9ad0-9696-5bd1-a8fc-68d9debd7a2b"] :answer-field/correct "b92588a3-3fa2-54c2-83ba-e428830f5893" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "a18b5f63-dc6e-5c60-bea1-6d3675dd37d9" :question/id #uuid "a18b5f63-dc6e-5c60-bea1-6d3675dd37d9" :question/problem "What is the gradient of the product $f(x,y)h(x,y)$ if $f(x,y)=(x-3){e}^{(y+4)}$ and $h(x,y)=(y+4){e}^{(x-3)}?$" :question/worked-solution "The gradient of the product of two functions $f(x,y)$ and $h(x,y)$ is given by:\n\n$$\n∇[fh]=f\\,∇\\,h+h\\,∇\\,f\\,\\,\n$$\n\nNow, we calculate the partial derivatives of $f(x,y):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂x} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}((x-3){e}^{(y+4)})={e}^{(y+4)} \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂y} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}((x-3){e}^{(y+4)})=(x-3){e}^{(y+4)}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇f(x,y) & =\\frac{∂f}{∂x}\\text{ }i+\\frac{∂f}{∂y}\\text{ }j={e}^